MODULE: OperationReturnsCrashLosesProgress
TARGET: OperationReturns
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: crash loses the resumable phase but keeps the operation's reservation
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ running' = FALSE /\ faults' = faults + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, maps, operation, phase, source, captured, copied, fenced,
--- REPLACE
    /\ running' = FALSE /\ faults' = faults + 1
    /\ phase' = "idle"
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, maps, operation, source, captured, copied, fenced,
--- END
